## Does Website Design or Development Affect SEO?

Both can influence how well a website supports search visibility, although neither guarantees high rankings.

### How Design Can Support SEO

Good design can make content easier to read and navigate.

A clear page structure helps visitors find information, while logical layouts and useful navigation can make important pages easier to discover.

Designers should also consider mobile layouts, readability, and how content is organized.

### How Development Can Support SEO

Development affects the technical foundations of a website.

Depending on the implementation, this can include:

- Page loading performance
- Mobile functionality
- Crawlable links
- URL structure
- Indexability settings
- Redirects
- Structured data
- Sitemap configuration
- Technical errors that prevent pages from working correctly

The quality of the content matters too. A technically sound website with unhelpful content may still struggle to attract relevant visitors.

SEO should therefore be considered throughout planning, design, development, and content creation rather than added only after launch.

